==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|softnesse}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sōftnes}}, alteration of earlier {{m|ang|sēftnes}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|soft|ness}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɔftnəs/|a=GenAm}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɑftnəs/|a=cot-caught}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɒftnəs/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-softness.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# The [[quality]] of being [[soft]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|hardness}}

